## How to Ingest New Raw Files

When a new source file is added to `raw/`:

1. Read the file and verify its actual date (do not trust the filename date).
2. Create a source summary page in `wiki/sources/` using the Source Page Template below.
3. Extract all knowledge. Create new wiki pages or update existing ones following the Page Template below.
4. Update `wiki/index.md` with any new pages.
5. Update the relevant `domain-index-*.md` file(s).
6. Run stub cleanup: delete any pages under 600 bytes that contain only boilerplate.
7. Append a log entry to `wiki/log.md`.
8. Update `wiki/hot.md` with a summary of what changed.

