## Corrections Log

When a bot produces a wrong answer traceable to a wiki page, file a correction entry in `wiki/corrections.md`:

```
[YYYY-MM-DD] wiki/<path/to/page.md>
  Wrong: [the incorrect claim the bot made]
  Correct: [the right answer]
  Source: [what proves the correction]
  Action: [whether the page was updated, and what changed]
```

Update the corrected page's `source-date:` frontmatter to today's date. One correction properly filed is worth more than ten perfect pages.

